{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53099","headline":"岁日送王十三判官之松州幕 · 殷济","name":"岁日送王十三判官之松州幕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"异方新岁自然悲，三友那堪更别离。\n虏酒未倾心已醉，愁容相顾懒题诗。\n三边罢战犹长策，二国通和藉六奇。\n伫听莺迁当此日，归鸿莫使尺书迟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷济","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53099.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53099","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}